                "text": "People with intellectual and developmental disabilities deserve equal access to quality healthcare.\n\nThat's why I've introduced the HEADs UP Act to expand the I/DD community's access to care services and include them in dozens of gov't programs incentivizing research and care. \ud83c\udfe5 https://t.co/akBBYJw9Se",
