                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "\u201cThat bill no longer exists. What was once an example of compromise and functioning government has become an ode to bigotry & ignorance.\n\n\"Attacks on reproductive rights, access to basic healthcare, & efforts to address [racism] do harm to our national security.\"\n\n\ud83e\uddf54/5",
