                "reply_count": 18,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This #NDAA attacks reproductive rights & access to basic healthcare for women in uniform, marginalizes essentially any group that isn\u2019t white & male, and condones discrimination to whitewash our country\u2019s history.\n\nIt does not adequately support our troops.\n\nI will be voting no.",
