                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We have a mental health crisis in this country, plain and simple.\n\nWe need to both invest in expanding access to mental healthcare for everyone and address the root causes head-on.\n\nIf you or a loved one are in a crisis, text or call \ud83d\udcde988 for free, 24/7 emergency counseling.",
