                "text": "This week my team is holding office hours in three communities across the district. My staff can help you with your Social Security, Medicare, Veterans services, & more.\n\nIf we can't complete it in the hour, we'll take down your information and follow up to help however we can! https://t.co/DVnrShDfEz",
