                "text": "Massachusetts is at the vanguard of both biotech and medical innovation.\n\nThank you to  @SmithNephewPLC for showing me around your Andover facility! \n\nIt was a pleasure to meet employees and to learn about their groundbreaking work in restorative healthcare right here in #MA06. https://t.co/EHV5TjLgnQ",
