                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "In the lead up to 51st anniversary of Roe v Wade, Republicans held votes to fund deceptive so-called \u201ccrisis pregnancy centers\u201d and deny students access to comprehensive info about their healthcare options.\n\n@HouseDemocrats are united in fighting back against their war on women. https://t.co/zKMe1J0A2d",
