                "reply_count": 64,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "51 years ago, #RoevWade affirmed a woman's right to make her own healthcare decisions. 1.5 years ago, that right was ripped away.\n\nToday, I\u2019m joining the #KnowYourRights Project b/c the fight is far from over. Americans deserve knowledge & resources about reproductive healthcare.",
